    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARY: So, you just have the one house? Oprah has like four but it's all good. You'll get there, boo.\nMEEKA: What's going on in here?",
      "MARY: Ay that's me. I'm Mary. But think of me as your second momma.\nLISA: Mmm, you don't have to though.\nMARY: Mmm, but you should. Cause I kinda am.",
      "OMMA: I always thought Meeka was gonna be Queen.\nTINASHE: Psh! A woman isn't allowed to rule Zamunda. Idiot.\nMEEKA: Please, excuse me.",
      "MARY: There's my baaaaby!\nMEEKA: Don't you have a dress like that?\nLISA: I did.\nMARY: Thanks, girl. It took me forever to find it in your closet.",
      "LISA: No, you use the salad fork for the salad.\nMARY: I'm going to use this little fork for my salad.\nLISA: That's the oyster fork.\nMARY: What do I use it for?"
    ]
