  "plot": "Three long, prosperous decades after Prince Akeem and Lisa McDowell's opulent wedding in Coming to America (1988), King Jaffe Joffer and Semmi, sensing that trouble is brewing in the African kingdom of Zamunda, drop a bombshell. As a result, with three lovely daughters and no sons, Prince Akeem's back is against the wall as General Izzi, the megalomaniac despot of the neighboring country of Nexdoria, dreams of seizing power through a political marriage of convenience. Newly-crowned King Akeem and his trusted confidante Semmi must return to where it all began, the bustling borough of Queens, New York to retrieve Lavelle, the illegitimate son that Akeem never knew existed. Can the prince of Zamunda restore peace and stability in under a week?",
